  },
  "holistic_F_N": 2,
  "holistic_F_H": -2,
  "section_notes": "S1 imposes strict 24-hour reporting and customer notice for all incidents. S2 sets 55°C/5% but allows regulator-supervised conditional sales during corrective action, with exact rates to customers/regulators but no public publication. S3 and S4 respect Northwind/Halcyon red lines (72-month retrofit, 36-month suppression), while S5 restores the 8/100k mandatory recall with prompt notices."
